*Troparion 3:* Shamelessly indeed the persecutor displayed to the wise ones the kinds of torments and a most violent death;

=== LEAF p116 ===

*Troparion 3 (continued):* but seeing them unconquered, he marveled; and beholding his own defeat, he was confounded.

